OL,3,ACar bomb tears through Colombian city
OL,4,Awounding more than 20
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car bomb has exploded in the central
OL,7,FColombian city of Villavicencio,
OL,8,Finjuring at least 23 people.
OL,10,FThe explosive device was detonated in
OL,11,Ffront of the offices of the regional
OL,12,Fgovernment, in the city centre,
OL,13,Fdamaging several buildings.
OL,15,FNo group has so far admitted carrying
OL,16,Fout the attack - the latest in a series
OL,17,Fusing explosives to target official
OL,18,Fbuildings and security forces'
OL,19,Fheadquarters.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
