OL,3,ACar bomb tears through Colombian city
OL,4,Awounding more than 20
OL,5,
OL,6,FColombian President Abelardo de la
OL,7,FEspriella blamed "narcoterrorism", but
OL,8,Fgave no details. Armed criminal groups
OL,9,Fhave recently stepped up attacks in
OL,10,Fwhat appears to be retaliation for an
OL,11,Foffensive ordered against them by De la
OL,12,FEspriella.
